// Section 0. Page metadata.
//
// The description names the humidity, which is the local hook and the honest
// reason this service exists here rather than a generic one. It claims
// removal of surface mould specifically, not remediation, and promises
// nothing about it staying away.
//
// ⚠️ BOTH REWRITTEN 15 Sep 2026 (copy and search review of this page).
//
// TITLE. This is the approved title from mapping workbook row 6, which was
// never implemented. It carries the mapped primary `mould cleaning services`
// (350/mo, mapping workbook, 10 Aug 2026) unsplit, and "Removal" carries the
// mapped secondary `mould removal services`. 48 characters, no decoration.
//
// 🚩 DESCRIPTION SET FROM THE KEYWORD WORKBOOK 16 Sep 2026, on TLB's
// explicit instruction to ship the workbook copy verbatim. 145 characters,
// matching the workbook's own length column exactly. This reverses the
// 15 Sep ruling recorded here, which replaced the workbook line rather than
// implementing it. That objection was not withdrawn on its merits, so it
// stands on the record and TLB has accepted it:
//
//  1. ⚠️ "Book an inspection today" is flatly contradicted by section 4 of
//     this page, which says "Not an inspection and not a report". A visitor
//     who clicks the SERP snippet to book an inspection lands on copy
//     telling them we do not do one. These two cannot both be right; the
//     body copy was left as-is because the instruction was to change the
//     meta, not the page. Whoever answers the phone should expect callers
//     asking to book the inspection this snippet offers.
//  2. The mapped primary `mould cleaning services` (350/mo, mapping
//     workbook, 10 Aug 2026) is not contiguous in this line; "Mould
//     cleaning and removal" is the closest it gets. The title still carries
//     the primary verbatim.
//  3. The standing geo phrase is gone, replaced by "humid coastal homes".
//     That is a climate descriptor, not a service area, so this page's meta
//     now names no footprint. It also retires the Tweed-vs-Queensland trade
//     this comment used to flag: there is no geo phrase left to extend.
//  4. "Done safely and properly" sits next to section 4's deliberate
//     refusal to publish a method. It claims a standard the page will not
//     detail, which is defensible but is the sort of line to have an answer
//     ready for.
const pageMeta = {
  title: 'Mould Cleaning Services & Removal | TLB Cleaning',
  description:
    'Mould cleaning and removal for humid coastal homes, done safely and properly. Bathrooms, walls, ceilings and wardrobes. Book an inspection today.',
  canonical: 'https://tlbcleaning.com.au/house-cleaning/mould-removal/',
};

