// "Get an instant quote" everywhere, and on THIS page that promised the one
// thing the copy then withdraws: section 12 says outright that condition
// sets the price and a job like this cannot be priced sight unseen, and the
// whole page is built on sending a photo first. A button offering an instant
// number contradicted the sentence above it.
//
// Overridden here rather than in navigation.ts because that export serves
// every page, including the genuinely instant-priceable ones. The site-wide
// split is still the Phase 2.3 / step 7 job in WEBSITE-UPDATE-PLAN-BFD-V2.md.
// `href` is unchanged, so it routes exactly where it did.
//
// Four instances on this page take it: the hero, pathway card 1, the booking
// block and the closing CTA. Header and footer chrome keep the shared label
// deliberately, same call deep-cleaning.astro made: that is site navigation,
// not this page's argument, and the conflict between the two header CTAs is
// a site-wide decision above this page (BFD §9.5 and §13.2 currently
// contradict each other on it).
const pageQuoteCta = { ...quoteCta, label: 'Get a fast quote' };

